{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月3日 \" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261103.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】本台早前揭發有「白牌車」接載內地旅客離港，警方連日發起打擊及拘捕行動。究竟跨境「白牌車」為何禁之不絕？怎樣才是長遠的治本方案？</p><p>周二《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論 。</p><p>題目：跨境白牌車問題</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:06.210722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:55:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.050162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:29.389009+00:00","content_hash":"446fc5db5dde08da0f70e60fca4aa381624c54eae401c1292ae03fb8fe212445","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:06.210722+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}